<title>UK: Essen Hypo prices 2.0 billion mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo prices 2.0 billion mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier has been priced by joint lead managers BayerVB, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, HSBC Trinkaus and WestLB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    16.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.85     PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    98.68     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> LISTING    DUSS</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =/AAA     DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    8 BP	SELL CONC  17 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND SERIES 122 BOBL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
